<section class="reading wrap"><span class="eyebrow">PEOPLE KEEP THIS PLACE GOING</span><h1 class="page-title">Pay what you can.<br><em>Belong either way.</em></h1><p class="lead">The same apps. The same space in the community. Whether you contribute $0, $3, $10, or a helping hand.</p><div class="contribution-options"><span>$0 <small>always welcome</small></span><span>$3 <small>a little thanks</small></span><span>$10 <small>keep it growing</small></span><span>You choose <small>no fixed plan</small></span></div><div class="panel"><h2>Help keep the lights on</h2><p>Voluntary contributions help cover hosting, backups, and the time it takes to tend this little corner of the web. There are no premium features, ads, or paid rankings.</p><?php if(cfg('donation_url')&&!cfg('demo')):?><a class="button" href="<?=esc(web_url(cfg('donation_url')))?>" rel="noopener noreferrer">Choose your contribution ↗</a><p class="help">You’ll continue to the operator’s payment provider. Review the currency, amount and frequency there before paying. This app does not collect card details.</p><?php else:?><div class="note">Contributions are not connected on this instance yet. You can still use the tools, share a useful link, or contribute to the code.</div><?php endif?></div><h2>Money is one way to contribute.</h2><div class="entry-grid"><div><h3>Share a discovery</h3><p>Add a Canadian maker, a little website, or a useful resource.</p><a href="/directory/submit">Add to the directory →</a></div><div><h3>Make it better</h3><p>Fix a bug, improve the documentation, or suggest something useful.</p><a href="<?=esc(cfg('source_url'))?>">Explore the code →</a></div><div><h3>Be a good neighbour</h3><p>Say hello in someone’s guestbook. Credit your sources. Welcome a newcomer.</p><a href="/garden">Meet the garden →</a></div></div><p class="help">Contributions are support for the service, not charitable tax-receipted donations. The instance operator must publish any financial reporting separately; this release does not track payments or display invented funding totals.</p></section>
